  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n`html/semantics/forms/the-select-element/customizable-select/select-picker-hover-active-pseudo.html` has some expectations around how `:hover` and `:active` match, but I don't see this reflected in the specification. They do seem like reasonable changes however.\n\ncc @nt1m @mfreed7 @josepharhar @whatwg/css ",
